 Iceberg schema updates are **metadata changes**, so no data files need to be rewritten to perform the update.
 
+!!! info
+    When tables are managed through a Hive Metastore catalog, the Hive Metastore (HMS) version can constrain or
+    otherwise affect schema-evolution operations. See the [Hive documentation](hive.md#schema-evolution) for details.
+
 Note that map keys do not support adding or dropping struct fields that would change equality.
 
